<title>INDIA: India RBI accepts one bid for 20 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India RBI accepts one bid for 20 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India said it accepted one bid for 20 billion rupees at Thursday's repo auction.</p>
<p>-- Bomnbay Newsroom (91) 22 265 9000; Fax (91) 22 264 1699</p>
